!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was extracted with Trizol and further purified with a Qiagen Rneasy Plus kit
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries were prepared for sequencing using standard protocols at BGI
!Sample_data_processing = Base-calling was performed with the BGISEQ-500 software, version 0.3.8.1111
!Sample_data_processing = Raw reads were subjected to quality control, filtered into clean reads and aligned to the reference sequences with Bowtie2 (parameters: -q --phred64 --sensitive --dpad 0 --gbar 99999999 --mp 1,1 --np 1 --score-min L,0,-0.1 -p 16 -k 200) and HISAT (parameters: -p 8 --phred64 --sensitive -I 1 -X 1000).
!Sample_data_processing = Gene quantification was performed with RSEM and expression levels calculated with the FPKM method.
!Sample_data_processing = To identify DEGs, FDR ≤ 0.001 and the absolute value of Log2Ratio ≥ 1' were used as default thresholds to judge the significance of gene expression difference.
